### Create a new card
POST http://localhost:9090/api/create?mobileNumber=4354437687

### Fetch card details by mobile number
GET http://localhost:9090/api/fetch?mobileNumber=4354437687

### Update card details (put the real cardNumber from the fetch response in update-card.json)
PUT http://localhost:9090/api/update
Content-Type: application/json

< ./update-card.json

### Delete card by mobile number
DELETE http://localhost:9090/api/delete?mobileNumber=4354437687
